---
// VoltaPix CTA Section
---

<section class="vp-cta-section">
	<div aria-hidden="true" class="vp-cta-glow"></div>
	<div aria-hidden="true" class="vp-cta-grain"></div>
	<div class="vp-cta-container">
		<div>
			<h2 class="vp-cta-heading">
				Reembolso corporativo sem planilha 
				<span class="vp-cta-highlight"> via WhatsApp.</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="vp-cta-subheading">
				Sua equipe envia o recibo pelo WhatsApp, a IA extrai valor e CNPJ em segundos e você aprova em lote. Experimente grátis por 45 dias — sem cartão de crédito.
			</p>
			<div class="vp-cta-actions">
				<a class="vp-cta-btn-primary group" href="https://voltapix.com.br/signup?origem=blog_cta" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Testar por 45 dias grátis
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true">
						<path d="M5 12h14"></path>
						<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path>
					</svg>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.vp-cta-section {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		background-color: #0b0f19;
		padding: 6rem 0;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.vp-cta-section {
			padding: 8rem 0;
		}
	}

	.vp-cta-glow {
		pointer-events: none;
		position: absolute;
		left: 50%;
		top: 50%;
		height: 500px;
		width: 900px;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background-color: rgba(0, 74, 234, 0.25);
		filter: blur(130px);
	}

	.vp-cta-grain {
		pointer-events: none;
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		opacity: 0.05;
		mix-blend-mode: overlay;
		background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');
	}

	.vp-cta-container {
		position: relative;
		margin: 0 auto;
		max-width: 48rem;
		padding-left: 1rem;
		padding-right: 1rem;
		text-align: center;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.vp-cta-container {
			padding-left: 1.5rem;
			padding-right: 1.5rem;
		}
	}

	.vp-cta-heading {
		font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif;
		font-size: 2.25rem;
		font-weight: 800;
		line-height: 1.15;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
		color: #ffffff;
		margin: 0;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.vp-cta-heading {
			font-size: 3.5rem;
		}
	}

	.vp-cta-highlight {
		background-image: linear-gradient(to right, #60a5fa, #004AEA);
		-webkit-background-clip: text;
		background-clip: text;
		color: transparent;
	}

	.vp-cta-subheading {
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		max-width: 36rem;
		font-size: 1.125rem;
		line-height: 1.625;
		color: #94a3b8;
	}

	.vp-cta-actions {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.vp-cta-actions {
			flex-direction: row;
		}
	}

	.vp-cta-btn-primary {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		background-color: #004AEA;
		padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		color: #ffffff;
		text-decoration: none;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 74, 234, 0.35), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 74, 234, 0.3);
		transition: all 0.2s;
	}
	.vp-cta-btn-primary:hover {
		background-color: #0038C4;
		box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 74, 234, 0.5), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 74, 234, 0.5);
		transform: translateY(-2px);
	}

	.lucide-arrow-right {
		height: 1.25rem;
		width: 1.25rem;
		transition: transform 0.2s;
	}
	.vp-cta-btn-primary:hover .lucide-arrow-right {
		transform: translateX(0.25rem);
	}
</style>
